# Internal Meeting Transcript Tagging

When processing a meeting transcript from `ReadAIMeeting`, check the attendee/participant list. If the **only** attendees are one of the pairs below, apply the corresponding classification:

## Rules

| Attendees (exactly) | Classification | CRM Assignment |
|---|---|---|
| Bill Douglas + Drew Hall | Internal | Drew Hall |
| Bill Douglas + Danny Demichele | Internal | Danny Demichele |

## Behavior

1. **Mark as internal** — set the meeting's type/category to "internal" (or the equivalent field in the current workflow).
2. **Tag the CRM assignment** — assign the non-Bill attendee listed above in the CRM Assignment field.
3. These rules apply regardless of who scheduled the meeting or which calendar it originated from.
4. If additional attendees are present beyond the pair, do **not** auto-classify as internal — follow normal processing.
